# Claude — 本地 agent 状态全忽略。两处例外是项目级产物，随仓走：
# verify-pacman（验证 harness）与 hillclimb（评测数据：输入集、判分口径、跑分）。
# hillclimb 的 trace、report.html、trajectory、progress 是派生/体量面，仍忽略。
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/verify-pacman/
!.claude/hillclimb/
.claude/hillclimb/*/baseline/traces/
.claude/hillclimb/*/report.html
.claude/hillclimb/*/trajectory/
.claude/hillclimb/**/progress.txt
.codegraph/

# playwright MCP session dir
.playwright-mcp/

# playwright test artefacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
